sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant PP as Payment Processing
    participant BI as AquaCo Adapter<br/>(Biller Integration)
    participant AQ as AquaCo (mock)
    participant W as Accounts & Wallet
    participant L as Ledger
    participant N as Notifications
    participant SMS as SMS Provider

    Note over PP,W: Precondition: payment P-123 is in FundsHeld.<br/>352.50 EGP (350.00 bill + 2.50 fee) has moved from available to held.

    PP->>PP: transition FundsHeld → SentToBiller
    PP->>BI: pay(reference P-123, account, 350.00 EGP)
    BI->>BI: map domain request to SOAP-style XML
    BI->>AQ: POST payment XML (reference P-123)
    AQ-->>BI: XML fault, errorCode = AQ-417
    BI->>BI: map AQ-417 to "Amount exceeds the water bill due"
    BI-->>PP: BillerRefused(code AQ-417, reason)

    PP->>PP: transition SentToBiller → Failed (store code and reason)

    PP->>W: releaseHold(P-123, 352.50 EGP)
    activate W
    W->>L: append entry HOLD_RELEASE<br/>held −352.50, available +352.50, ref P-123
    L-->>W: entry saved (balances recomputed from ledger)
    W-->>PP: hold released
    deactivate W

    PP->>PP: transition Failed → Refunded (final state)
    PP->>PP: write audit record (who, when, why)

    PP-)N: PaymentRefunded event (P-123, reason)
    N->>SMS: send SMS "Your water bill payment P-123 failed:<br/>amount exceeds the bill due. 352.50 EGP is back in your wallet."
    SMS-->>N: delivered
    N-->>C: SMS received

    alt SMS provider down
        N->>N: retry up to 3 times, then mark undelivered
        Note over N: The refund stands even if the SMS fails (hard case 5)
    end
